## Performance Optimizations

### 1. Memoization Strategy
- React.memo for all components with prop comparisons
- useMemo for expensive computations
- useCallback for event handlers
- Custom comparison functions for complex props

### 2. Virtualization
- Implement virtual scrolling for lists >50 items
- Lazy loading for heavy components
- Intersection Observer for off-screen components

### 3. Code Splitting
- Dynamic imports for heavy components
- Lazy loading for rarely used features
- Bundle size optimization

## Integration Patterns

### 1. Prop Interfaces
- Consistent prop naming conventions
- Generic type support where appropriate
- Optional props with sensible defaults
- Comprehensive prop documentation

### 2. Event Handling
- Consistent callback patterns
- Event bubbling considerations
- Keyboard navigation support
- Accessibility compliance

### 3. Styling
- Consistent spacing using Raycast design tokens
- Theme-aware components
- Responsive behavior
- Icon consistency

## Key Deliverables
- Complete component library with 15+ reusable components
- Performance-optimized implementations
- Comprehensive TypeScript prop interfaces
- Storybook documentation (optional)
- Component unit tests
- Usage examples and guidelines

## Success Criteria
- All components render without errors
- Performance benchmarks show improved render times
- Components pass accessibility audits
- Zero TypeScript errors in component implementations
- Consistent visual design across all components
- Components successfully integrate with existing commands
